{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09905","headline":"送陶铣弃举荆南觐省 · 岑参","name":"送陶铣弃举荆南觐省","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明时不爱璧，浪迹东南游。\n何必世人识，知君轻五侯。\n采兰度汉水，问绢过荆州。\n异国有归兴，去乡无客愁。\n天寒楚塞雨，月净襄阳秋。\n坐见吾道远，令人看白头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}